e_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z3V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a304091f-072a-480f-9f24-4769f4648899","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/slacklog/CJMV3MSLR/2021/04/#ts-1617349403.321400\u003e\nこれか!なるほど　やっと意味を理解した","ts":"1622286833.487600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZIRja"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f300bdf-8cf9-4271-9eed-c3259d3a44c1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあ使いどころがよく分からない機能ではありますね。\nちなみにマクロでも同様で、 `qQ` で記録を開始したマクロは `qq` で記録したときの結果（`\"q` レジスタに保存されるキーストローク）に追記されます","ts":"1622285361.487300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Qjz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b57841b5-caf8-48d4-afcf-895bfd7a2ea5","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u0026gt; 「\"A」のように大文字で指定すると、レジスタの既存の内容の後ろに追記されます。\n\u0026gt; \n初めて知った","ts":"1622279886.486000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":4,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U9S4G0LJW","U01J7703PFT","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SjN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e2b1776-3d01-42df-bed0-26063fe67c63","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"読んだ　\u003chttps://oplern.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/04/16/174653\u003e","ts":"1622278835.485800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Man On a Mission: Vim備忘録 コピペとレジスタ - Man On a Mission","id":1,"title":"Vim備忘録 コピペとレジスタ - Man On a Mission","title_link":"https://oplern.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/04/16/174653","text":"先日、Linuxにおけるクリップボード機能についての記事を書きました。 \u003chttp://oplern.hatenablog.com|oplern.hatenablog.com\u003e 上記記事中、少しVimのコピペ機能におけるクリップボード連携に触れています。 一般的なテキストエディタ、例えばWindowsのメモ帳やLinuxのgedit、LeafpadなどではOSなどの機能を使ってコピペが実現されています。（WindowsではOSのクリップボード機能、Linuxでは、X Window SystemのXセレクション。）それに対して、Vimでのコピペは、Vim独自方式で行われます。Vimでコピー（yank）や削除したテキストは、レジスタと呼ばれる領域に格納されま…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/10328537792365095503/10328749687237375641/1531712511","blocks":null,"ts":1492332413,"service_name":"Man On a Mission","service_icon":"https://oplern.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://oplern.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/04/16/174653","original_url":"https://oplern.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/04/16/174653"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8mJt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc22eac6-65ff-4c3c-a62c-2e4912509c85","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"今まで適当に unnamed(plus) だけ設定してよくわからないままお茶を濁してきた","ts":"1622278749.485600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OH4J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5a6c964-3d3b-4856-8c1c-e99736e679e1","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"Vim のレジスタをVim歴9年目にして初めて理解しようと試みる","ts":"1622278655.485200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"722"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c7b6345-bd18-458e-86dd-4282727a7de9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そうです","ts":"1622278539.484700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3dt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79952a95-19ad-40b9-b5e4-f91fbfd479a5","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"deniteお試し期間\nsourceを複数同時にぶっこめるので\nfxf.vimの:Filesと:Buffersを同時に起動する的なことができる様子\nしかもdelete操作ができるのでdeniteバッファ内でバッファとかファイルを削除可能だと...\nzennにまとめるか","ts":"1622275090.484300","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1622275421.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aveN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44ad0c0f-4c80-45f0-8228-a41c7b57c2b3","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"yacc から syntax を自動生成してほしい（わがまま）","ts":"1622266206.483000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E+V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1456ea49-ceda-4129-adbb-2dad67448126","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"syntax何もわからない","ts":"1622266127.482600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OhI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1365f37-b827-4164-be74-d89ae0c8ddc0","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"syntax ﾑｽﾞｶｼｲ、推奨される書き方をできているかどうか全然わからない","ts":"1622266081.482300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KV26p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2517b570-f7b7-4adc-b7d4-a545b3af953f","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"唯一思いついた実用的なものは `rogue` ですねw","ts":"1622264216.481900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/xi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0481600c-9a30-4f8b-ab91-1c524acd8735","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"どちらも実用的かと言われれば微妙なところです…。","ts":"1622263944.481000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JY8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"595e82e1-b702-4413-b44c-af941450f89a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、cool-retro-term触ってみてました","ts":"1622263833.479800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eZ7Ab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bec37219-5c2e-4eb0-8c6d-687d75b4f879","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"eDEX-UIはElectron。cool-retro-termはC++/Qt製みたいです。","ts":"1622263782.479300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wGbT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22c5fc17-458c-4f30-be4a-23d312ea49ae","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そんなに文句があるってわけじゃなくて動いてくれなくてちょっと気になったくらいでした\n見てなかったけどElectron製なんですね","ts":"1622263658.479000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bYQ/I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9051a06-f49d-404a-8277-37f08ad6f7c6","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Electron製なので仕方ないかと…。","ts":"1622263582.477900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xQP1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54a07e3d-fcab-4e9c-ba53-667e2f755415","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとこれは設定かもしれないですけど、MetaをCommandで渡したいけど端末に取られちゃってますね","ts":"1622262485.477400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZdx7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ea37e43-ead4-4f16-b8b3-5158b5a9e42b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"レトロさとディスプレイの大きさが完全に噛み合っていない","ts":"1622262381.476700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VhrZa"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"すごい・・・","ts":"1622262337.476400","files":[{"id":"F023C3534QM","created":1622262328,"timestamp":1622262328,"name":"CleanShot 2021-05-29 at 13.25.11.png","title":"CleanShot 2021-05-29 at 13.25.11.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U8996GYBF","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":7556664,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023C3534QM/cleanshot_2021-05-29_at_13.25.11.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023C3534QM/download/cleanshot_2021-05-29_at_13.25.11.png","original_h":1577,"original_w":3840,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023C3534QM-d9c0feff01/cleanshot_2021-05-29_at_13.25.11_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023C3534QM-d9c0feff01/cleanshot_2021-05-29_at_13.25.11_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023C3534QM-d9c0feff01/cleanshot_2021-05-29_at_13.25.11_160.png","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023C3534QM-d9c0feff01/cleanshot_2021-05-29_at_13.25.11_360.png","thum